# A self-install into this repo. `node -e "import('./src/bin/install.mjs')"`
# RUNS the script — importing a script executes it — so a syntax check performed
# that way silently installs the skill into its own source tree. Use
# `node --check` instead. Ignored so the accident is visible-but-harmless rather
# than committed.
